---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Termeni si conditii — Tapselo POS"
  description="Termenii de utilizare a aplicatiei Tapselo POS: cont, abonament, integrarea Facebook Messenger, date, raspundere si legea aplicabila."
>
  <Navbar />

  <header class="bg-primary pt-28 pb-16 md:pt-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl italic text-white sm:text-5xl">
        Termeni si conditii
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-on-primary/80">
        Regulile de folosire a aplicatiei Tapselo POS, pe scurt si fara jargon.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-text-on-primary/50">
        Ultima actualizare: 17 august 2026
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="bg-surface-white py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-12 px-6">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl italic text-primary">Cine suntem</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Tapselo POS este operat de <strong class="font-bold text-primary">Ciocanel Razvan Tudor PFA</strong>,
          Romania. Pentru orice intrebare despre acesti termeni, scrie-ne la
          <a href="mailto:contact@tapselo.com" class="font-bold text-accent hover:text-accent-hover">contact@tapselo.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl italic text-primary">Serviciul</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Tapselo este un software de casa de marcat si de gestiune a comenzilor pentru magazine
          alimentare mici. Serviciul este oferit ca abonament. Accesul se face pe baza de cont.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl italic text-primary">Contul tau</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Esti responsabil de confidentialitatea datelor de autentificare. Un cont acopera un
          magazin, iar in cont poti invita utilizatori care lucreaza in acel magazin.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl italic text-primary">Utilizare acceptabila</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Foloseste Tapselo numai pentru activitatea legala a magazinului tau. Nu sunt permise
          abuzul asupra serviciului, revanzarea lui si incercarile de acces neautorizat.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl italic text-primary">Integrarea Facebook Messenger</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Integrarea este optionala. Cand conectezi o pagina de Facebook, ne autorizezi sa
          procesam mesajele primite pe acea pagina conform
          <a href="/privacy" class="font-bold text-accent hover:text-accent-hover">Politicii de confidentialitate</a>.
          Poti deconecta pagina oricand din panoul de administrare.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl italic text-primary">Date si continut</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Datele magazinului tau raman ale tale. Le poti exporta sau poti cere stergerea lor.
          Vezi pagina
          <a href="/data-deletion" class="font-bold text-accent hover:text-accent-hover">Stergerea datelor</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl italic text-primary">Disponibilitate si raspundere</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Serviciul este oferit "ca atare". Facem eforturi rezonabile pentru disponibilitatea lui,
          dar nu garantam functionarea neintrerupta.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Raspunderea noastra este limitata la valoarea abonamentului platit in ultimele 12 luni.
          Obligatiile fiscale ale magazinului, de exemplu emiterea bonurilor si rapoartele catre
          ANAF, raman responsabilitatea magazinului.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl italic text-primary">Modificari</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Putem actualiza acesti termeni. Anuntam schimbarile importante prin email, la adresa
          contului.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl italic text-primary">Legea aplicabila</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Se aplica legea romana. Litigiile se judeca la instantele competente din Romania.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface p-6 md:p-8">
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl italic text-primary">English summary</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Tapselo POS is point-of-sale and order management software for small food shops, operated
          by Ciocanel Razvan Tudor PFA (Romania). Contact:
          <a href="mailto:contact@tapselo.com" class="font-bold text-accent hover:text-accent-hover">contact@tapselo.com</a>.
          The service is sold as a subscription and access requires an account: one account per
          store, with invited users.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          You are responsible for keeping your login details private. Use the service only for your
          store's lawful business. Abuse, resale and unauthorized access attempts are not allowed.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          The Facebook Messenger integration is optional. Connecting a Page authorizes us to process
          the messages it receives, as described in the
          <a href="/privacy" class="font-bold text-accent hover:text-accent-hover">privacy policy</a>.
          You can disconnect at any time. Your store data stays yours: you can export it or request
          deletion via the
          <a href="/data-deletion" class="font-bold text-accent hover:text-accent-hover">data deletion page</a>.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          The service is provided "as is". We make reasonable efforts to keep it available. Our
          liability is limited to the subscription fees paid in the last 12 months. Fiscal
          obligations (receipts, ANAF reports) remain the store's responsibility. We may update
          these terms and will announce important changes by email. Romanian law applies and
          disputes go to the competent courts in Romania. Last updated: 17 August 2026.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
